entire system before starting. It also doesn't hurt to quiesce any
running applications before you get started. Layered products will
likely need to be removed then reinstalled from the 5.1B media when
you're done but see below...

BEFORE YOU DO ANYTHING, here's a great Best Practices document from HP
for performing installupdate Tru64 upgrades:

http://h30097.www3.hp.com/docs/best_practices/BP_SYSUPDATE/TITLE.HTM

read the whole thing.

Best of luck

Jack
